  \nToo bold, too cold, no rehearsal  \nBuilt this crown from universal  \n\nChain reaction when I breathe that fire  \nOne line, whole room go higher  \nNo pause, no fear, full ignition  \nThis that global transmission  \n\n[Pre-Chorus - R&B]\nPull me closer, slow it down  \nHeartbeat under the sound  \nWhen you whisper my name like that  \nI forget where the edges are  \n\nLights go low, voices melt  \nEvery note just how I felt  \nHold your breath, let it bloom  \nSomething ’bout to break real soon  \n\n[Chorus - Pop Explosion]\nBoom, boom, feel it in your chest  \nWhen the beat drop, we the best  \nHands up high, don’t overthink  \nSay my name, make the whole world blink  \n\nFlash, flash, colors collide  \nWe don’t wait, we ignite  \nRound and round, stuck in your brain  \nThis that hook you won’t escape  \n\n[Post-Chorus - Chant]\nHey!  \nTurn it l\n", 291994863475564, "fixed", 190, 180, "4", "zh", "E minor", true, 2, 0.85, 0.9, 0, 0], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 261, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "tags"}, "name": "tags", "link": 265, "label": "tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "link": 266, "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 257, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "bpm"}, "name": "bpm", "label": "bpm", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "bpm"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration"}, "name": "duration", "link": 251, "label": "duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "timesignature"}, "name": "timesignature", "label": "timesignature", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "timesignature"}, {"widget": {"name": "language"}, "name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "language"}, {"widget": {"name": "keyscale"}, "name": "keyscale", "label": "keyscale", "type